        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.333,
        "phon_examples": "祠/翅 宗/中",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "正好对到我们那个中翅子。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 59.619,
      "end": 64.775,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "这个宗祠后面，这个面，这个有靠山。",
      "score": 0.2723,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.0311,
        "sc_logprob": -0.9704,
        "sc_delta": 0.0607,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.216,
        "seg_cer": 1.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "不是粽子后面，粽子后面，粽子后面，就是有烤山。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 65.151,
      "end": 68.372,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "宗祠里的石刻碑文我们暂且不提，",
      "score": 0.2161,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.498,
        "sc_logprob": -0.515,
        "sc_delta": -0.017,
