      "start": 149.094,
      "end": 152.115,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "为什么典史官嘞？他是在这里，",
      "score": 0.3742,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.3416,
        "sc_logprob": -1.3441,
        "sc_delta": -0.0025,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.335,
        "seg_cer": 0.583,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "嘞",
        "text_free": "为什么喊电视馆呢？它是咱这里。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 152.137,
      "end": 158.008,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "那陈洪谋又是乾隆皇帝在下到下期的时候，",
      "score": 0.5787,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -2.5696,
        "sc_logprob": -2.5225,
        "sc_delta": 0.0471,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.805,
        "seg_cer": 0.667,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那成龙毛，有时和成龙兄弟在下到象棋的时候。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 158.008,
      "end": 161.676,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "他正在旁边吵嘛，他小把爷有点大，",
      "score": 0.2233,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.7849,
        "sc_logprob": -0.7578,
        "sc_delta": 0.0272,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.122,
        "seg_cer": 0.5,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "都是讲他近在旁边炒嘛，他小把爷天天大。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 161.676,
      "end": 165.05,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "两两岁一个，两岁，可能也超过三岁的。",
      "score": 0.82,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -3.482,
        "sc_logprob": -3.6351,
        "sc_delta": -0.1531,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 1.0,
        "lang_free": "Cantonese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "你同你美國，肯定一就咗三水啲嘢。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 165.655,
      "end": 169.13,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "小把爷，大把爷，小把爷，他正在旁边吵。",
      "score": 0.1219,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.36,
        "sc_logprob": -0.3273,
        "sc_delta": 0.0327,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.267,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "小把爷，小把爷，小把爷啊！他经常旁边吵。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 169.13,
      "end": 171.613,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "嗯，这这吵吵吵，我要要，",
      "score": 0.1806,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.5709,
        "sc_logprob": -0.6658,
        "sc_delta": -0.095,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.04,
        "seg_cer": 0.889,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "嗯，他一直在，常常他问我要要。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 171.755,
      "end": 174.236,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "我要要什么东西？哎，搞不清楚。",
      "score": 0.1153,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.4722,
        "sc_logprob": -0.519,
        "sc_delta": -0.0468,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.002,
        "seg_cer": 0.25,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "我要，他要什么东西，反正搞不清楚。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 174.236,
      "end": 177.497,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "皇帝，他一一下期嘛，你正在吵，",
      "score": 0.6256,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -2.8048,
        "sc_logprob": -2.7156,
        "sc_delta": 0.0892,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.895,
        "seg_cer": 0.667,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "反正他也下到气嘛，你紧来吵。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 177.497,
      "end": 181.031,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "吵他不是讲。马超他想要什么就给他嘛，",
      "score": 0.3749,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.7757,
        "sc_logprob": -2.0048,
        "sc_delta": -0.229,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.501,
        "seg_cer": 0.25,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "炒他不是讲，我炒他，想要什么都给他嘛。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 181.647,
      "end": 185.435,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "陈摩那心里头好有数的，给他嘛给，",
      "score": 0.2074,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.7052,
        "sc_logprob": -0.7029,
        "sc_delta": 0.0023,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.091,
        "seg_cer": 0.357,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "乔木，他心里头好有数的。给一袋嘛，给。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 185.445,
      "end": 191.241,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "你讲了给，那都马人那其他的人子都一跪跪下个谢祖宗嘞，",
      "score": 0.4093,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.4136,
        "sc_logprob": -1.4425,
        "sc_delta": -0.0289,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.362,
        "seg_cer": 0.542,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.083,
        "phon_examples": "祖/主",
        "lexicon": "嘞",
        "text_free": "你将他给那个马，那个拿起他的孙子，就一跪跪下高，谢主龙啊！"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 191.241,
      "end": 194.979,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "他晓得要要什么的。就是像那样子，",
      "score": 0.4577,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.761,
        "sc_logprob": -1.7912,
        "sc_delta": -0.0303,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.496,
        "seg_cer": 0.357,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "晓得",
        "text_free": "他晓得他要要什么的，就是下个他要。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 195.125,
      "end": 199.327,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "他都直接哎呀，要要，他晓得找哪个要嘛，",
